KRides Privacy Policy

Last updated: May 6, 2026

1. Introduction
KRides ("we", "our", or "us") operates a campus ride-hailing service. This policy explains what personal data we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that data.

2. Data We Collect

Category	Specific Data	Why
Identity	Name, email, phone number, profile photo	Account creation and ride identification
Location	Real-time GPS coordinates, pickup/drop-off addresses	Matching drivers, calculating routes
Payment	Flutterwave transaction IDs, wallet balance, bank account details (drivers only)	Processing payments and driver payouts
Ride History	Pickup/destination, fare, timestamps, status	Trip records and customer support
Ratings	Star ratings and written reviews	Driver quality monitoring
Device	FCM push notification token	Real-time ride updates and alerts
Google Sign-In	Name, email, profile photo (if used)	Account authentication
3. How We Use Your Data

To provide and operate the ride-hailing service
To match customers with available drivers
To process payments and driver payouts
To send real-time ride notifications
To resolve disputes and support requests
To improve app performance and user experience
4. Data Sharing
We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with:

Flutterwave — to process payments (subject to their privacy policy)
Google Firebase — for authentication, database, and push notifications
Google Maps / Mapbox — to display maps and calculate routes
Cloudinary — to store profile photos
Other users only as needed (e.g. a driver sees your name and phone number for an active ride)
5. Data Retention
We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. Ride history is retained for 12 months. You may request deletion at any time (see Section 7).

6. Location Data
Location is collected only while the app is in use and only to provide ride services. We do not track your location in the background or sell location data to third parties.

7. Your Rights
You may:

Access or correct your personal data via the Profile screen in the app
Request deletion of your account and associated data by contacting us
Withdraw consent at any time by deleting your account
8. Children
KRides is not intended for users under 16 years of age. We do not knowingly collect data from children.

9. Security
All data is transmitted over HTTPS. Firebase Authentication secures your credentials. Bank account details are stored encrypted and used only for payout processing.

10. Contact
For privacy questions or data deletion requests, contact us at: kampusrides24@gmail.com
